    <h1>GATE 2027 syllabus guide</h1>
    <p class="lead">GATE 2027 syllabi have been revised and a new paper (RA — Robotics &amp; Automation) was added. Always study from the <strong>2027 edition PDF</strong> for your paper — not old PDFs, coaching summaries or videos alone.</p>
    <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn primary" href="https://gate2027.iitm.ac.in/exam_papers_and_syllabus" rel="noopener">Open official syllabus page</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/gate-2027/papers/">Paper directory</a></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap grid cols-2">
    <div class="card"><h3>How to use the syllabus</h3><ol><li>Download your paper's 2027 PDF from the official page.</li><li>Split it into General Aptitude + subjects.</li><li>Map each subject to topics on this site (<a href="/learn/">Learn</a>).</li><li>Mark each topic: new / learning / needs review / stable.</li><li>Attach one primary resource + practice per subject (<a href="/resources/">Resources</a>).</li></ol></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Per-paper topic maps</h3><ul><li><a href="/learn/cs/">CS subjects &amp; topics</a></li><li><a href="/learn/ec/">EC subjects &amp; topics</a></li><li><a href="/learn/ee/">EE subjects &amp; topics</a></li><li><a href="/learn/me/">ME subjects &amp; topics</a></li><li><a href="/learn/ce/">CE subjects &amp; topics</a></li><li><a href="/learn/da/">DA subjects &amp; topics</a></li></ul><p class="meta">Full 30-paper list: <a href="/gate-2027/papers/">papers</a>. Remaining papers get topic maps as contributors add them.</p></div>
  </div></section>
